{"artifact_kind":"issue_comment","external_id":"issue_comment-4786223225","fetched_at":"2026-07-25T18:35:09.814290+00:00","raw":{"author_association":"NONE","body":"Opened a fix for this in #36857.\n\nRoot cause: `isChromatic` is created before the `useResizeDetector()` hook, then read by the `ref` callback and also captured by the `className` expression. Its reactive scope ends up spanning the hook call, and since scopes can't span hooks they're pruned wholesale — so the ref callback never memoizes and gets a fresh identity every render (the detach/reattach you're seeing).\n\nThe PR makes hook/`use()` calls act as reactive-scope barriers so the ref callback memoizes independently. Added a regression fixture based on your repro; full compiler fixture suite passes with no regressions.","created_at":"2026-06-24T05:36:49Z","html_url":"https://github.com/react/react/issues/36800#issuecomment-4786223225","id":4786223225,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react/react/issues/36800","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAJy2Ks8AAAABHUf4eQ","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":1,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":1,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react/react/issues/comments/4786223225/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-06-24T05:36:49Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/react/react/issues/comments/4786223225","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/148074828?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vismayIO/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vismayIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vismayIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vismayIO/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vismayIO","id":148074828,"login":"vismayIO","node_id":"U_kgDOCNNxTA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vismayIO/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/visma